1349                         
1350                         ; The next routine, which immediately follows the galaxy setup 
1351                         ; routine, is the short range scan. The location of each of the objects 
1352                         ; contained in the current quadrant is displayed as illustrated in the 
1353                         ; sample short range scan in Chapter One. By the use of the ROWSET, 
1354                         ; BINDEC, DIGPRT, and MSG subroutines, each line of the scan is 
1355                         ; prepared and output to the display device. This routine is entered 
1356                         ; following the galaxy setup to display the initial quadrant; then after 
1357                         ; each move by the space ship either within the quadrant or when a 
1358                         ; new quadrant is entered, and in response to a command to display 
1359                         ; a short range scan. 
1360                         
1361 0a65 ce 01 70           SRSCN       LDX         #MSG03      ; Set pointer for short range scan 
1362 0a68 bd 05 06                       JSR         MSG         ; Print initial row
1363 0a6b c6 01                          LDAB        #$01        ; Set row number one
1364 0a6d bd 06 76                       JSR         ROWSET      ; Set up row for printout
1365 0a70 86 32                          LDAA        #$32        ; 
1366 0a72 90 50                          SUBA        NSR         ; Calculate stardate number
1367 0a74 97 26                          STAA        STORE1      ; Save temporarily
1368 0a76 de 56                          LDX         PSTR1       ; Set pointer to binary value
1369 0a78 c6 01                          LDAB        #$01        ; Set precision counter
1370 0a7a bd 05 29                       JSR         BINDEC      ; Convert to current stardate 
1371 0a7d ce 01 b6                       LDX         #Msg05a+1   ; Set pointer to stardate message (was $01B6)
1372 0a80 c6 02                          LDAB        #$02        ; Set counter to number of digits 
1373 0a82 bd 06 62                       JSR         DIGPRT      ; Put digits in stardate message
1374 0a85 ce 01 a8                       LDX         #MSG05      ; Set pointer to message
1375 0a88 8d 24                          BSR         SRSCN1      ; Print stardate message
1376                         
1377 0a8a c6 02                          LDAB        #$02        ; Set row number two
1378 0a8c bd 06 76                       JSR         ROWSET      ; Set up row for printout
1379 0a8f 96 35                          LDAA        CQC         ; Fetch current quadrant contents
1380 0a91 ce 01 c3                       LDX         #Msg06a     ; Set pointer to condition message ( was $01C3 )
1381 0a94 84 30                          ANDA        #$30        ; Alien ship in quadrant? 
1382 0a96 26 19                          BNE         RED         ; Yes, condition red
1383 0a98 86 47                          LDAA        #'G        ; No, condition green (was $C7)
1384 0a9a a7 00                          STAA        0,X         ; Fill in ‘GREEN’ in
1385 0a9c 86 52                          LDAA        #'R         ;  condition message  ( was $D2 )
1386 0a9e a7 01                          STAA        $01,X       ; 
1387 0aa0 86 45                          LDAA        #'E         ; (was $C5)
1388 0aa2 a7 02                          STAA        $02,X       ; 
1389                         ;x          LDAA        #'E         ; (was $C5)
1390 0aa4 01                             NOP                     ; 2nd E is
1391 0aa5 01                             NOP                     ;  Same as previous char, so no need to reload
1392 0aa6 a7 03                          STAA        $03,X       ; 
1393 0aa8 86 4e                          LDAA        #'N         ; (was $CE)
1394 0aaa a7 04                          STAA        $04,X       ; 
1395 0aac 20 11                          BRA         CND         ; Output condition message
1396 0aae 7e 05 06           SRSCN1      JMP         MSG         ; 
1397                         
1398 0ab1 86 52              RED         LDAA        #'R         ; Condition red (was $D2)
1399 0ab3 a7 00                          STAA        0,X         ; 
1400 0ab5 86 45                          LDAA        #'E         ; Fill in ‘RED’ in (was $C5)
1401 0ab7 a7 01                          STAA        $01,X       ;  condition message 
1402 0ab9 86 44                          LDAA        #'D         ; (was $C4)
1403 0abb a7 02                          STAA        $02,X       ; 
1404 0abd 6f 03                          CLR         $03,X       ; 
1405                         
1406 0abf ce 01 b8           CND         LDX         #MSG06      ; Set pointer to condition message
1407 0ac2 8d ea                          BSR         SRSCN1      ; Print condition message
1408                         
1409 0ac4 c6 03                          LDAB        #$03        ; Set row number three 
1410 0ac6 bd 06 76                       JSR         ROWSET      ; Set up for printout
1411 0ac9 bd 07 02                       JSR         QUAD        ; Print current quadrant
1412                         
1413 0acc c6 04                          LDAB        #$04        ; Set row number four
1414 0ace bd 06 76                       JSR         ROWSET      ; Set up for printout
1415 0ad1 ce 01 e3                       LDX         #Msg08a     ; Set up sector message (was $01E3)
1416 0ad4 df 20                          STX         PNTR1       ; Pointer in storage
1417 0ad6 de 5a                          LDX         PSLOSS      ; Pointer to current sector
1418 0ad8 bd 07 12                       JSR         TWO         ; Put two digits in message
1419 0adb ce 01 d8                       LDX         #MSG08      ; Set pointer to sector message
1420 0ade 8d ce                          BSR         SRSCN1      ; Print sector message
1421                         
1422 0ae0 c6 05                          LDAB        #$05        ; Set row number five 
1423 0ae2 bd 06 76                       JSR         ROWSET      ; Set up row for printout
1424 0ae5 de 66                          LDX         PDVME       ; Set pointer to main energy 
1425 0ae7 c6 02                          LDAB        #$02        ; Set precision counter 
1426 0ae9 bd 05 29                       JSR         BINDEC      ; Convert to decimal 
1427 0aec ce 01 f5                       LDX         #Msg09a+3   ; Message pointer 
1428 0aef c6 04                          LDAB        #$04        ; Counter for four digits 
1429 0af1 bd 06 62                       JSR         DIGPRT      ; Put digits in message 
1430 0af4 ce 01 e7                       LDX         #MSG09      ; Set pointer to energy message 
1431 0af7 8d b5                          BSR         SRSCN1      ; Print energy message 
1432 0af9 c6 06                          LDAB        #$06        ; Set row number six 
1433 0afb bd 06 76                       JSR         ROWSET      ; Set up for printout 
1434 0afe ce 00 4d                       LDX         #NTR        ; Pointer to torpedo count 
1435 0b01 c6 01                          LDAB        #$01        ; Precision =1 
1436 0b03 bd 05 29                       JSR         BINDEC      ; Convert to decimal 
1437 0b06 ce 02 03                       LDX         #Msg10a+1   ; Set pointer to torpedo message 
1438 0b09 c6 02                          LDAB        #$02        ; Counter to number of digits 
1439 0b0b bd 06 62                       JSR         DIGPRT      ; Put number of torpedoes in message 
1440 0b0e ce 01 f7                       LDX         #MSG10      ; 
1441 0b11 bd 0a ae                       JSR         SRSCN1      ; Print torpedo message 
1442                         
1443 0b14 c6 07                          LDAB        #$07        ; Set row number seven 
1444 0b16 bd 06 76                       JSR         ROWSET      ; Set up row for printout 
1445 0b19 de 68                          LDX         PDVSE       ; Set pointer to shield energy 
1446 0b1b c6 02                          LDAB        #$02        ; And set precision for 
1447 0b1d bd 05 29                       JSR         BINDEC      ;  binary to decimal conversion
1448 0b20 ce 02 13                       LDX         #Msg11a+3   ; Set pointer to shield energy message (was $0213)
1449 0b23 c6 04                          LDAB        #$04        ; Set digit count 
1450 0b25 bd 06 62                       JSR         DIGPRT      ; Put digits in memory 
1451 0b28 ce 02 05                       LDX         #MSG11      ; Set pointer to shield message 
1452 0b2b bd 05 06                       JSR         MSG         ; Print shield message 
1453                         
1454 0b2e c6 08                          LDAB        #$08        ; Set row number eight 
1455 0b30 bd 06 76                       JSR         ROWSET      ; Set up row for printout 
1456 0b33 ce 01 70                       LDX         #MSG03      ; Set pointer to final row 
1457 0b36 bd 05 06                       JSR         MSG         ; Print final row 
